<body>

    <h1>Steps to Install Visual Studio Code</h1>

    <ol>
        <li>Open your web browser.</li>
        <li>Visit the official Visual Studio Code website.</li>
        <li>Click on the Download button.</li>
        <li>Run the downloaded setup file.</li>
        <li>Follow the instructions to complete installation.</li>
    </ol>

</body>
